00:25:40,810 --> 00:25:42,040
我们的这款软件
The software we have

428
00:25:42,150 --> 00:25:46,010
那一天拍摄了大约3000张照片，
has managed to take about 3,000 pictures on that day

429
00:25:46,120 --> 00:25:47,810
然后总结压缩到
and summarized them down

